WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.190
Dream...

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.230
There is an end in a dream...

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.480
In a fun dream, in a scary dream...

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.780
In the warm futon, your mother wakes you up,

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.820
and the dream is interrupted...

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.330
The view of the morning that never, never changes...

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.580
But, for now...

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.240
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

